<template>
  <section>
    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">pdx-data-source Wrapper</h2>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">Zero wiring: <code>pdx-data-source</code> provides DataSource to both List and Pagination via context. No explicit <code>:source</code> needed.</p>
    <details class="source-block">
      <summary>Source (Pattern)</summary>
      <pre class="pdx-txt-mono"><code>&lt;pdx-data-source url="/api/users" :page-size="5"&gt;
  &lt;pdx-list clickable dividers&gt;
    &#64;snippet item(item) &#123; &#123;&#123; item.name &#125;&#125; &#125;
  &lt;/pdx-list&gt;
  &lt;pdx-pagination&gt;&lt;/pdx-pagination&gt;
&lt;/pdx-data-source&gt;

// Both components auto-inject the DataSource from context.
// Pagination reads total/page, List reads data/isLoading.
// Page change → DataSource.setPage() → List auto-reloads.</code></pre>
    </details>
  </section>
</template>
